{% include 'elements/header.twig' %}
<div class="pt-3 mt-5 row">
	<div class="col">
		<h1 class="mb-3 text-center h2">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p>
			<strong>Last updated: 07 Aug 2025</strong>
		</p>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">1. Definitions</h2>
			<p>
				<strong>Personal Information</strong>: any information that identifies you as an individual.</p>
			<p>
				<strong>Non-Personal Information</strong>: includes anonymous or aggregated data not linked to you personally.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
			<p>We do not collect your personal information.</p>
			<p>We may collect
				<strong>non-personal data</strong>, such as:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Browser type, device model, IP address (anonymized), usage patterns</li>
				<li>Cookies to remember preferences</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">3. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
			<p>Yes—we use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Store your preferences for future visits</li>
				<li>Help deliver relevant ads via third parties</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">4. Third-Party Advertisements</h2>
			<p>Some advertisements are served by third parties (ad networks, analytics). These may collect non‑personal data through cookies, pixels, or other technologies. Our Privacy Policy does not cover their practices.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">5. Your Data Rights</h2>
			<p>Since we do not collect personal data, there are no personal data rights to manage. However, should that change, you will have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">6. Data Security</h2>
			<p>We take reasonable measures to protect data, including using HTTPS. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is completely secure—use at your own risk.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">7. International Data Transfers</h2>
			<p>Any non-personal data may be processed or stored in countries with different data protection laws. By using the Site, you consent to these transfers.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
			<p>We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. We'll post the latest version here. Continued use after updates means you accept the changes.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="mb-3">
			<h2 class="h4">9. Contact Us</h2>
			<p>If you have any questions about this policy, please contact us.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
